{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-100681:  expat security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[2.7.3-67]\n- CVE-2026-118370 expat: expat: Denial of Service via integer overflow\n  during XML attribute parsing\n\n[2.7.3-66]\n- CVE-2026-117610 expat: expat: Denial of Service via NULL pointer\n  dereference in external entity parsing\n\n[2.7.3-65]\n- CVE-2026-113351 expat: expat: Denial of Service via improper memory\n  tracking in XML_ParserReset\n\n[2.7.3-64]\n- CVE-2026-115506 expat: expat: Denial of Service via delayed entity\n  amplification detection\n\n[2.7.3-63]\n- CVE-2026-102633 expat: expat: Denial of Service via integer overflow in\n  expat_realloc\n\n[2.7.3-62]\n- CVE-2026-77214 expat: expat: Information disclosure via heap buffer over-\n  read in XML_ParseBuffer\n\n[2.7.3-61]\n- CVE-2026-66046 expat: Expat: Denial of Service via quadratic complexity\n  in attribute processing\n\n[2.7.3-60]\n- CVE-2026-93990 expat: Expat: XML Injection via Malformed UTF-16 Input\n\n[2.7.3-59]\n- Fix CVE-2026-56132: out-of-bound scaffolding index store in doProlog\n\n[2.7.3-58]\n- Fix CVE-2026-50219: forbid XML_ParserFree/Reset from handlers",
